"我可能最怕被觉得“要求太多”，或者……有点不正经吧。其实我也知道这样想很矛盾，一边想知道自己到底怎么了，一边又怕被贴标签。<第6轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":12,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"056883d063c541f2bffec0db622efb71","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0035932782821864856,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":7,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6affb63f59efdd25482154d5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143231577,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb63959efdd25482154c7","chatId":"d0d8c94c3de548929646e4c98750030a","sessionId":null,"userId":129588,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"咨询当然有界限，比如保密例外和安全边界，但不会因为你的感受就评判你不正常。你可以慢慢说。你最担心我听到哪一部分后，会怎么看你呢？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"咨询当然有界限，比如保密例外和安全边界，但不会因为你的感受就评判你不正常。你可以慢慢说。你最担心我听到哪一部分后，会怎么看你呢？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2537,"promptTokens":155,"completionTokens":258,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":11,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"1cc720649a264fb19d451e2838ff352e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005219620251034367,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb63959efdd25482154c6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143225576,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb63959efdd25482154c6","chatId":"d0d8c94c3de548929646e4c98750030a","sessionId":null,"userId":129588,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……大多是两个人比较亲近的时候吧。可我现在还不太想讲太细，我怕你也会觉得我不正常。你们做咨询的，是不是也有什么不能聊的界限？<第5轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":10,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"1cc720649a264fb19d451e2838ff352e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005219620251034367,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6affb63959efdd25482154c7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795143225574,"createTime":"2026-11-20 10:53:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6affb63459efdd25482154b9","chatId":"d0d8c94c3de548929646e4c98750030a","sessionId":null,"userId":129588,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听起来你既想说出来，又害怕他的反应，这种压着的感觉确实很难受。你愿意先说说，那些想法通常是在什么情境下冒出来的吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听起来你既想说出来，又害怕他的反应，这种压着的感觉确实很难受。你愿意先说说，那些想法通常是在什么情境下冒出来的吗？","options"